# The forest wolf's body (#331, D101, D114): the `dead` frame of wolf.grid, pixel for pixel, in a decor-tier palette (D76):
# hand-set tone roles (contour k, belly light m, flank b/c, shade a/d, legs l/L, fang f) on one dark dried umber, as the
# spider's and the snail's bodies; no ink 0b0814, no moon rim, so a harmless body never reads as a live wolf.
# Keep it in step with wolf.grid.
size 48 24
color k 1e0600
color d 220800
color a 250a00
color b 2d1001
color c 2f1202
color m 341b0c
color p 341b0c
color l 2a1103
color L 2f1608
color e 2f1202
color f 341b0c
frame body
